---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About me">
  <article class="page-content">
    <img src="/img/headshot.jpg" class="headshot" alt="Nate Barbettini" />

    <h4>Hi, I'm Nate.</h4>

    <p>
      I build products and teams that solve problems. My superpower is distilling complexity
      and communicating solutions in a clear, approachable way.
    </p>

    <p>
      I've been a startup co-founder, CTO, full-stack developer, technical instructor,
      developer advocate, and technical product manager, and Microsoft MVP. I'm currently a founding engineer at
       <a href="https://arcade.dev">Arcade.dev</a>, building the platform AI agents need to operate securely in the real world.
    </p>

    <h4>Useful things I've built</h4>

    <p>
      I like making things that help developers:
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://mcpdebugger.dev">MCP Debugger</a>, a tool to help Model Context Protocol server devs test their servers as an agent would</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=996OiexHze0">OAuth and OpenID Connect in Plain English</a> (the most-watched OAuth explainer in the world!)</li>
        <li><a href="https://oidcdebugger.com">OIDC Debugger</a>, a tool to easily test OAuth and OpenID Connect flows
        <li><a href="/book/">The Little ASP.NET Core Book</a>, a royalty-free book to help devs learn the ASP.NET Core web framework
      </ul>
    </p>

    <p>
      You can follow me on X (<a href="https://x.com/nbarbettini">@nbarbettini</a>) to get notified
      whenever I publish anything new.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
